# ---- Per-run evidence from the G11-D3 and G12 acceptance suites ----
# These four directories hold screenshots and measurement JSON that a spec writes on every run.
# They are evidence of a run, not a baseline a future diff compares against: the curated
# baseline is the 408 tracked PNGs governed by tests/ci/tracked-png-budget.json, which has
# ZERO file headroom (408/408). 76 files / 8.4 MB here would break that ceiling, and every
# one of them is regenerated by the command named in its directory's design doc:
#   artifacts/g11-d3  - tests/ui/g11-incident-slice.spec.ts, g11-page-header-growth.spec.ts
#   artifacts/g12b    - tests/ui/g12-evidence-content.spec.ts
#   artifacts/g12c    - tests/ui/g12-lifecycle.spec.ts
#   artifacts/g12d    - tests/ui/g12d-workspace.spec.ts, tests/ci/g12_acceptance_ci.sh
# CI uploads g12b/g12c/g12d as workflow artifacts (7-day retention). Declared here so that
# `git status` reports a clean tree and a stray `git add` cannot turn a run log into history.
# Recorded 2026-11-02; rationale in docs/design/g11-incident/g11-d3-ui.md section 4.1.
artifacts/g11-d3/
artifacts/g12b/
artifacts/g12c/
artifacts/g12d/

# Visual System V1 baseline matrices are local evidence; promote individual images deliberately.
artifacts/ui/visual-v1/
